      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After testing this with the latest VRChat update the behaviour has either changed or I missed this in my last tests. But currently the shader seems to break if you test it in Build & Test but if you do Build & Upload instead the shader will work ingame. So the solution isn't as simple as what I thought with the Always Included Shaders but something is still going wrong.\nAnd there seems to be cases where shaders using Diffuse as fallback have issues currently. So if someone has any examples of that it would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
